{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NjvxfPAodhsAlzUAFUfbMg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:00.488017+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NjvxfPAodhsAlzUAFUfbMg","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/IlnkwACxKPgo4CgYuEajsubv9LhwVeibtqszEubzVbwB47uiciazY3ZV4zEOfrzzYofCBLn3A7eicXVN2tiak9DeVJw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/IlnkwACxKPgnDPRwibeuaRzICqmHFg4V9G18w0oicz1fpiak1G4NeXqrZIrCkjU5ybr5cpaLaUEMghacWEyZEhuicg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>为促进各高校优秀大学生之间互动交流，增进学生对我院各学科专业的认识与了解，并对有意以推荐免试方式报考我院硕士研究生的优秀大学生进行预选拔，上海大学悉尼工商学院将于</span><strong><span><span>6月底举办“2025年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营”</span></span></strong><span>，欢迎广大优秀学子报名参加！</span></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><b><span>一、学校简介</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>上海大学是上海市属的综合性研究型大学，是教育部与上海市人民政府共建高校，是</span><span><strong><span>国家“211 工程”重点建设高校</span></strong></span><span>、上海市高水平地方大学建设高校，是</span><span><strong><span>国家“双一流”建设高校</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>上海大学悉尼工商学院成立于1994年，是上海大学</span><span><strong><span>直属</span></strong></span><span>商学院，合作方为悉尼科技大学（2025 QS世界大学排名第88名）。2020年，学院通过AACSB认证。2024年，学院在“全球最佳商学院”排名中国大陆第25位。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><b><span>二、报名申请</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MVPvEL7Qg0Egj76lSPicXbCTgBVIialdvwWxbm21OZytaf8P6xK86NglUjbFn8agwwLkdNhBNdSRvMLtiaXKjEj7A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.申请资格</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><ul><li><p><span><span>全国高校本科三年级在校生（</span><span><strong><span>2026届</span></strong></span><span>本科毕业生）；</span></span></p></li></ul><p><span><span>学习成绩优异，本科前五学期总评成绩排名</span><span><strong><span>在专业前30</span></strong></span></span><strong><span><span>%</span></span></strong><span><strong><span>。</span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>*注：</span></strong><span>在科研、竞赛等方面有优异表现者（如在重要学术期刊上发表论文、获得国际级或国家级竞赛奖项等），上述排名要求可适当放宽。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MVPvEL7Qg0Egj76lSPicXbCTgBVIialdvwWxbm21OZytaf8P6xK86NglUjbFn8agwwLkdNhBNdSRvMLtiaXKjEj7A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.申请专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>目前学院针对以下研究生专业开放报名申请。</span></p></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><section><p><strong><span>类型</span></strong></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><b><span>专业</span></b></p><p><b><span>代码</span></b></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><strong><span>专业</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>名称</span></strong></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><strong><span>学制</span></strong></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>学术型硕士</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>020202</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>区域经济学</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>2.5年</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>学术型硕士</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>120100</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>管理科学与工程</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>2.5年</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>学术型硕士</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>120202</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>企业管理</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>2.5年</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>专业型硕士</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>025100</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>金融</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>2年</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>专业型硕士</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>125300</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>会计</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>2年</span></p></section></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MVPvEL7Qg0Egj76lSPicXbCTgBVIialdvwWxbm21OZytaf8P6xK86NglUjbFn8agwwLkdNhBNdSRvMLtiaXKjEj7A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span>1）报名申请</span></strong></span></p><p><span>有意向参加的同学，请登录学院研究生招生报名系统（<a href=\"http://47.99.79.115/Home/Login\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://47.99.79.115/Home/Login</a>），或在学院官网（<a href=\"http://silc.shu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://silc.shu.edu.cn/</a>）点击页面底端链接，注册登录“研究生招生报名系统”，在“上海大学优秀大学生夏令营报名”板块完成申请。</span></p><p><span>如遇系统内部错误无法填写，可通过问卷提交报名信息：https://jsj.top/f/tMWe2Q</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/IlnkwACxKPgnDPRwibeuaRzICqmHFg4V9TVwKjK6M09TIAzib1SEM8IPcQU4YVAP5QibraomDL9Dp4p5rHQiaEfNTQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/IlnkwACxKPgnDPRwibeuaRzICqmHFg4V98Mwl5ewiaV4bwBwnq3Outj1gqesPutgnsaiayqMicEN9Ie4werPVCe10A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>2）材料提交</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>请按要求准备以下材料：</span></span></p><ul><li><p><span><span>《上海大学悉尼工商学院优秀大学生暑期夏令营个人陈述》；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>《上海大学悉尼工商学院优秀大学生暑期夏令营推荐表》（</span><span><strong><span>签字并盖章</span></strong></span><span>）；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>本科阶段成绩单、专业排名、英语水平证明（</span><span><strong><span>盖章版</span></strong></span><span>）；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>获奖证书及其他证明材料。</span></span></p></li></ul><p><span><span>材料模板请复制下方链接至浏览器进行下载：</span></span></p><p><span>https://pan.baidu.com/s/1UsLN48JNdnAANDxeCLnfKQ?pwd=hw6w 提取码: hw6w</span><span><span> </span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>请将以上材料</span><span><strong><span>扫描命名后</span></strong></span><span>，在报名系统中上传。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MVPvEL7Qg0Egj76lSPicXbCTgBVIialdvwWxbm21OZytaf8P6xK86NglUjbFn8agwwLkdNhBNdSRvMLtiaXKjEj7A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4.申请初筛</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>夏令营的报名申请通道</span><span><strong><span>将于</span></strong></span><strong><span><span>6月7日24时截止</span></span></strong><span>。</span><span><span>初审筛选通过的同学，将在</span><strong><span>一周后</span></strong><span>通过邮件、系统站内信、短信等形式通知本人，或在上海大学悉尼工商学院官网公布。未入选的同学将不再另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span>注：报名系统显示审核通过仅代表报名成功，实际入营资格请以邮件通知为准。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>三、活动安排</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>上海大学悉尼工商学院全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营</span><span><strong><span>将于6月底开展</span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></span><span>期间将开展学术讲座、导师交流会、优秀学长学姐面对面、个性化考核等众多内容丰富的活动。具体开展时间、形式、内容等相关安排，将另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>四、优营政策</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>参加我院夏令营，并考核优秀的同学，如在9月推免预报名填报我院对应专业，可直接获得面试资格，并在录取时</span></span><span><span>予以</span></span><span><strong><span>优先重点考虑</span></strong></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>推免生入学后，除享受研究生奖助政策外，还将享受学校和学院提供的如下优惠政策：</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>①第一学年学业奖学金排名优先（第二、三学年依据在校综合表现发放学业奖学金）；</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>②优先自主选择导师；</span></span></p><p><span><span>③优先进入学院优秀研究生奖励计划；</span></span></p><p><span><span>④优先推荐参加双硕士项目、国际交流；</span></span></p><p><span><span>⑤优先推荐硕博连读；</span></span></p><p><span><span>⑥优先申请学院国际交流基金。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>五、联系我们</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>邮箱：silc_yjszs@163.com</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>电话：021-69982847，17277968138  张老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>官网：<a href=\"https://silc.shu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://silc.shu.edu.cn/</a></span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/IlnkwACxKPgnDPRwibeuaRzICqmHFg4V9DN8l8nq3VFybWBcYL19LRVZkicCEGqRejPLEYia7icpVSge7ibFeMq9mMw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/IlnkwACxKPhBEcUFZKSSGAeSCPo0ZqEXNTcRELkG3JPcnViadJJibbXuKB94TmEOn7sam1hzq8UK2oG4dmOFnibJA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>投稿 / 上大悉尼工商学院研究生管理部</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>责编 / 刘小卓</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/IlnkwACxKPhBEcUFZKSSGAeSCPo0ZqEXxEOrIXdKjnib4HBH3dGNichTq6be0I89fknibYEVmqedwCxCx6OwlrOAw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"c70cce09cc7ad37e5bc3ed291ec48457144d8fa46229914b6ba2ff83a5582a54","textLength":1531,"sourceSha256":"6e518187ad86e025b564c828316ff4b7002eefbb72fb21dd61f9c57cc818dc9f","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-11d59b3715135fb4b33f","title":"2025年上海大学悉尼工商学院2025年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:00.488017+00:00"}
